    "IZAKHONO remains the authoritative origin and editorial control plane.",
    "Regional distribution may use external CDNs, social platforms, OTT partners and smart-TV apps.",
    "Every territory must pass rights, platform-policy and local regulatory review before targeted distribution.",
    "Language versions must preserve the original meaning and may not alter doctrine, testimony, attribution or rights metadata.",
